.TH PAINTLY 1 "September 2026" "Paintly 0.1.0" "Paintly Manual"
.SH NAME
paintly - fast, simple raster paint program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paintly
.RI < file >
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Paintly
is a fast, simple, native GTK4 painting app, designed to be simple and get the job done.
It supports transparency, layers, basic shapes, and common drawing tools.
.PP
.B Paintly
opens the specified image file for editing.
.SH FEATURES
.IP (bu 2
Pencil, brush, eraser, fill bucket and simple shapes.
.IP (bu 2
Layers with reordering, visibility toggles, per-layer opacity and live thumbnails.
.IP (bu 2
Dual primary/secondary colour selection on left and right mouse buttons.
.IP (bu 2
Undo history, selection and canvas resizing.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I file
Image file to open in Paintly.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B paintly image.png
Open
.I image.png
for editing.
